  "~41 auctions/yr; refunding / 2-5-7 weeks cluster ~3 auctions whose windows overlap on ONE asset",
  "icc = correlation of SIGNED positions' returns within a cluster = sign agreement x 1 (same instrument); ASSUMPTION 0.3, scenarios 0.1-0.6",
